  <h2>Shipping Activewear from China to Australia</h2>
  <p>For Australian buyers, shipping planning should be part of product development. Confirm carton quantity, product weight, delivery destination, and launch deadline before approving bulk production. Air freight is useful for urgent launches, while sea freight can reduce cost for larger replenishment orders.</p>

  <h2>Quality Checklist Before You Order</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm GSM, fabric composition, stretch recovery, and colorfastness.</li>
    <li>Request size measurements for leggings, sports bras, and tops before bulk cutting.</li>
    <li>Test opacity under squat movement, especially for light colors.</li>
    <li>Approve logo size, placement, and packaging mockups before production.</li>
    <li>Ask for final inspection photos and packing list before shipment.</li>
  </ul>

